{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"一、十有五年。春王正月，邾婁子來朝。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"二、鼷鼠食郊牛，牛死，改卜牛。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"曷為不言其所食？漫也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"三、二月辛丑，楚子滅胡，以胡子豹歸。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"四、夏五月辛亥，郊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"曷為以夏五月郊？三卜之運也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"五、壬申，公薨于高寢。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"六、鄭軒達帥師伐宋。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"七、齊侯、衞侯次于籧篨。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"八、邾婁子來奔喪。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"其言來奔喪何？奔喪，非禮也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"九、秋七月壬申，姒氏卒。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"姒氏者何？哀公之母也。何以不稱夫人？哀未君也。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"十、八月庚辰朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"十一、九月，滕子來會葬。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"十二、丁巳，葬我君定公。雨不克葬，戊午日下昃，乃克葬。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_17","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"十三、辛巳，葬定姒。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_18","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"定姒何以書葬？未踰年之君也，有子則廟，廟則書葬。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_cdt_227_19","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_227","textTraditional":"十四、冬，城漆。","sentenceOrder":19}],"overrides":{}}